+# READY FOR PEER REVIEW — PROG-09 consumer reader
+
+WORKER CLAIM:
+- agent: Codex GPT-5.6 Sol
+- ticket: PROG-09 / 09-consumer-reader
+- worker CLI session id: goal `01a005d5-c684-7d10-b28e-6a732921004a`
